    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "No worries, I just like to sprinkle in some fun facts and analogies to keep things interesting. \"Deadlifting like a goblin\" is just a playful way of saying you'll be lifting heavy weights with ease and agility, just like a mischievous goblin would. You know, those pesky creatures are known for their cunning and strength, so it's fitting that you'll be tapping into that same kind of power when you're deadlifting.\n\nBy the way, have you ever heard of the \"goblin's grip\"? It's a technique used by some weightlifters to improve their grip strength, especially when deadlifting. It involves using a specific grip position and finger placement to generate more power and control. But I digress... back to your program!",
